+# Roadmap: Gateway Releases
+
+---
+
+## Status Indicators
+
+- 🔴 Not Started
+- 🟡 In Progress
+- 🟢 Done
+- ⏸️ Blocked
+- ⚠️ Needs Review
+
+---
+
+## Overall Progress
+
+```
+Phase 1  Prune                      🟡 █░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   0%  (0/4)
+Phase 2  Install From An Archive    🔴 ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   0%  (0/3)
+TOTAL                                  ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░   0%  (0/7)
+```
+
+**Current Phase:** Phase 1: Prune
+**Blocked By:** —
+
+---
+
+## Why This Roadmap Exists
+
+`gateway install` adds a release under `~/.local/share/ai-ctl/llama-swap/` at each new llama-swap
+version, and nothing removes the old ones: about 43 MB each. `build prune` does it for the builds.
+A machine without the network, or a release fetched by another tool, cannot be installed either:
+`gateway install` always downloads.
+
+---
+
+## Decisions Taken At Opening
+
+- **`gateway prune --keep <N>`**, as `build prune`: every release but the `N` newest and the
+  current one removed.
+- **`gateway install --from <ARCHIVE>`**: the archive's digest checked against `--sha256` or the
+  pinned one, never against checksums that came with it.
+- **Branch:** `roadmap/gateway-releases`.
+
+---
+
+## Deliberately Out Of Scope
+
+- A `gateway list` command: `ls` shows the releases.
+- Removing a release by name.
+
+---
+
+## Phases
+
+- [Phase 1: Prune](phase-1-prune.md)
+- [Phase 2: Install From An Archive](phase-2-install-from-an-archive.md)
+
+---
+
+## Dependencies
+
+- Phase 2 builds on phase 1's store methods.
+
+---
+
+## Related Documentation
+
+- [docs/commands.md](../../../commands.md) — `build prune`, the model for `gateway prune`
+- [docs/security.md](../../../security.md) — the pinning of llama-swap's releases
+
+---
+
+## Metadata
+
+**Roadmap Status:** 🟡 In Progress
+**Created:** 2026-10-31
+**Branch:** roadmap/gateway-releases, from main at {{commit:0}}
