+# Phase 1: Prune
+
+---
+
+## Status
+
+**Current Status:** 🟡 In Progress (0% — 0/4)
+**Started:** 2026-10-31
+**Completed:** {{COMPLETION_DATE}}
+**Blocked By:** —
+
+---
+
+## Objective
+
+Remove the old llama-swap releases with `gateway prune --keep <N>`, as `build prune` removes the
+old builds.
+
+### Out of Scope
+Removing a release by name.
+
+---
+
+## Tasks
+
+### Prune
+- [ ] The releases a prune removes: every one but the `N` newest and the current one
+  Proof: domain tests
+- [ ] The store lists, measures and removes the installed releases
+  Proof: tests on the store
+- [ ] `gateway prune --keep <N>`: the use case and the command, printing what it removed and freed
+  Proof: tests on the use case and the command line
+- [ ] The command in `docs/commands.md` and the README
+  Proof: a reading of both
+
+---
+
+## Technical Details
+
+### Files to Modify
+```
+src/domain/gateway.rs
+src/application/gateway.rs, ports.rs, fakes.rs
+src/infrastructure/gateway_store.rs
+src/presentation/cli.rs, gateway.rs
+docs/commands.md, README.md
+```
+
+### Dependencies
+None.
+
+### Constraints
+- The current release is always kept: `up` runs it.
